OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after being hit by a
OL,4,Alorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has died after being hit by a
OL,7,Florry in Greater Manchester.
OL,9,FShe was struck by the vehicle just
OL,10,Fafter 15:30 BST on Tuesday in
OL,11,FRadcliffe, Bury.
OL,13,FGMP said the woman, in her 50s, died at
OL,14,Fthe scene in Church Street West.
OL,16,FPolice said no-one has been arrested
OL,17,Fand have appealed for witnesses and any
OL,18,FCCTV, doorbell or dashcam footage.
